# The build context of the API, website, MCP Admin and AI service images (apps/api/Dockerfile,
# apps/web/Dockerfile, apps/mcp-admin/Dockerfile, apps/ai-service/Dockerfile, built from the
# repository root) is an allowlist: the pnpm and uv workspace manifests and lockfiles, the four
# apps, the packages they are built from and the pnpm installation (infra/pnpm). Environment
# files, private notes (.context/), worktrees, scratch files, test results, virtual environments
# and build output never enter an image, and of the seeds only the fictional demo does
# (scripts/checks/image-content.mjs checks the built images for all of these).
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!apps/mcp-admin/
!apps/ai-service/
!infra/pnpm/
!packages/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/coverage/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.env
**/.env.*
packages/db/seed/*
!packages/db/seed/README.md
!packages/db/seed/demo/
